{
  "version": 1,
  "_note": "单包逐日下载(npm / PyPI / crates.io)。入参 eco、pkg、ver(1 = 顺带取最新版本与发布时间)。三个生态的响应形状各不相同,在这里归一成同一条 30 天逐日序列,渲染层不分生态。组件的流不做缓存(§5.5 契约 5)。",
  "actions": [
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uY",
        "value": "亿"
      },
      "_note": "中文量级单位落成键再引用:表达式里不直接写汉字(与半角逗号混在一个串里,文案闸会误报)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "uW",
        "value": "万"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "e0",
        "value": "$[toLowerCase::(findNotEmpty::(${eco},npm))]"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 入参落地(勿删):方法参数里的 ${} 看不见 flow 入参。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "pIn",
        "value": "${pkg}"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "vIn",
        "value": "$[findNotEmpty::(${ver},0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isC",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${e0},crates),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isP",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${e0},pypi),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "isN",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),0,if::(eq::(${isP},1),0,1))]"
      },
      "_note": "生态三选一:不认识的值一律按 npm。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "p",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isN},1),${pIn},toLowerCase::(${pIn}))]"
      },
      "_note": "PyPI / crates.io 的包名不分大小写,统一小写;npm 保留原样(npm 本来就只允许小写,且 scoped 包带 @ 与 /)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "hasP",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${p}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${hasP},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "no package selected"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "没有包名 = 这个组件没法取数,让流失败,平台显示上次数据或空态。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${isN}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rN",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://api.npmjs.org/downloads/range/last-month/${p}",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "npm:last-month = 截至数据最新一天(通常是 1~4 天前)的 30 个逐日值。scoped 包的 / 原样放在路径里即可。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${isN},1),if::(eq::(${vIn},1),1,0),0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "vN",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://registry.npmjs.org/${p}/latest",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sN",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://registry.npmjs.org/-/v1/search",
            "method": "GET",
            "queryParams": {
              "text": "${p}",
              "size": "5"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "版本:/latest 只有版本号没有发布时间(约 2KB);发布时间取搜索接口里「名字完全相同」那一条的 date。完整文档动辄几 MB,不用。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${isP}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rP",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://pypistats.org/api/packages/${p}/overall",
            "method": "GET",
            "queryParams": {
              "mirrors": "false"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "PyPI:pypistats 的 overall(不含镜像)≈180 天逐日、约 13KB。不用 /recent:它只有日/周/月三个数,算不了环比。pypistats 有按 IP 的限流(429),失败走 error 出口。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${isP},1),if::(eq::(${vIn},1),1,0),0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "vP",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://pypi.org/rss/project/${p}/releases.xml",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "string",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable-pkgstats/1 (+https://numable.app)",
              "Accept": "application/rss+xml"
            },
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "PyPI 版本:发布 RSS 约 10KB,带发布时间;/pypi/<包>/json 带全部历史文件,requests 就有 190KB+,不用。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${isC}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "rC",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/${p}/downloads",
            "method": "GET",
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable-pkgstats/1 (+https://numable.app)",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "crates.io:近 90 天逐日,按版本分行。⚠️ crates.io 要求请求带能表明来路的 User-Agent,缺了一律 403(2026-09-25 实测)——这个头是接口的生存条件,勿删。"
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),if::(eq::(${vIn},1),1,0),0)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "vC",
          "action": "request",
          "params": {
            "url": "https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/${p}",
            "method": "GET",
            "queryParams": {
              "include": "default_version"
            },
            "formatType": "json",
            "header": {
              "User-Agent": "Numable-pkgstats/1 (+https://numable.app)",
              "Accept": "application/json"
            },
            "timeout": "10000"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "include=default_version 把响应从 400KB+ 收到约 3KB,versions[0] 就是默认版本(带 created_at)。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "miss",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isN},1),if::(gt::(length::(${rN.downloads}),0),0,1),if::(eq::(${isP},1),if::(gt::(length::(${rP.data}),0),0,1),if::(gt::(length::(${rC.meta.extra_downloads}),0),0,1)))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "${miss}"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "sleep",
          "params": {
            "timestamp": "1500"
          },
          "_note": "参数名是 timestamp(写 duration 不报错、直接不等)。"
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${isN}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "rN",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://api.npmjs.org/downloads/range/last-month/${p}",
                "method": "GET",
                "formatType": "json",
                "timeout": "10000"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${isP}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "rP",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://pypistats.org/api/packages/${p}/overall",
                "method": "GET",
                "queryParams": {
                  "mirrors": "false"
                },
                "formatType": "json",
                "timeout": "10000"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "op": "if",
          "props": {
            "val": "${isC}"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "rC",
              "action": "request",
              "params": {
                "url": "https://crates.io/api/v1/crates/${p}/downloads",
                "method": "GET",
                "formatType": "json",
                "header": {
                  "User-Agent": "Numable-pkgstats/1 (+https://numable.app)",
                  "Accept": "application/json"
                },
                "timeout": "10000"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "_note": "只重试一次:包不存在(404)时第二次同样拿不到,流照常走 error 出口,不会无限等。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "_b2",
        "value": "1"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 请求/并发屏障(勿删):request 与 concurrent 之后**紧邻**的节点读不到响应(晚一拍合并,memory [[actionflow-concurrent-late-merge]])。删掉它 → 下面所有 index:: 静默取空 → 卡渲一片 `--`,而流仍报 success。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nN",
        "value": "$[length::(${rN.downloads})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "aN",
        "value": "$[pluck::(${rN.downloads},downloads)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nP",
        "value": "$[length::(${rP.data})]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "aP",
        "value": "$[pluck::(${rP.data},downloads)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dP",
        "value": "$[pluck::(${rP.data},date)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "acc",
        "value": {
          "_": "0"
        }
      },
      "_note": "按日期累加的容器(对象;键 = yyyy-MM-dd)。先放一个占位键,保证它是对象。"
    },
    {
      "op": "forEach",
      "props": {
        "items": "${rC.version_downloads}",
        "key": "it",
        "index": "i"
      },
      "_note": "⚠️ 首节点 _lb 是循环屏障(勿删):每轮第一个节点读的是进循环那一刻的快照,没有它 acc 的累加会丢掉同日前面几个版本(G41)。",
      "items": [
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "_lb",
            "value": "1"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "cur",
            "value": "$[calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},${it.date}),0)+findNotEmpty::(${it.downloads},0))]"
          }
        },
        {
          "op": "set",
          "props": {
            "key": "acc.${it.date}",
            "value": "${cur}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "dC",
        "value": "$[pluck::(${rC.meta.extra_downloads},date)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "xC",
        "value": "$[pluck::(${rC.meta.extra_downloads},downloads)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "nC",
        "value": "$[length::(${dC})]"
      },
      "_note": "crates.io 的最后一天是「今天(UTC)」,还没过完 —— 一律丢掉最后一天,只用完整的日子。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "endD",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-2)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${dP},calc::(${nP}-1)),${rN.end}))]"
      },
      "_note": "数据截至日(yyyy-MM-dd)。三个源都有 1~4 天延迟,组件上显示的是它,不是取数时刻。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "ok",
        "value": "$[if::(gt::(length::(${endD}),0),1,0)]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "if",
      "props": {
        "val": "$[if::(eq::(${ok},1),0,1)]"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "action": "error",
          "params": {
            "errorMsg": "no download data"
          }
        }
      ],
      "_note": "主干 = 数据截至日。包不存在(npm 回 error 体 / PyPI 404 / crates 404)、被限流、网络失败,都会让它为空 → 抛错,平台回落上次成功的数据,不渲一份空的上去。"
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v0",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-31))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-31)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-30)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-30))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v1",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-30))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-30)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-29)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-29))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v2",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-29))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-29)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-28)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-28))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v3",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-28))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-28)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-27)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-27))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v4",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-27))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-27)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-26)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-26))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v5",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-26))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-26)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-25)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-25))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v6",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-25))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-25)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-24)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-24))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v7",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-24))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-24)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-23)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-23))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v8",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-23))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-23)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-22)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-22))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v9",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-22))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-22)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-21)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-21))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v10",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-21))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-21)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-20)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-20))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v11",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-20))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-20)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-19)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-19))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v12",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-19))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-19)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-18)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-18))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v13",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-18))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-18)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-17)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-17))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v14",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-17))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-17)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-16)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-16))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v15",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-16))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-16)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-15)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-15))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v16",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-15))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-15)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-14)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-14))))]"
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "set",
      "props": {
        "key": "v17",
        "value": "$[if::(eq::(${isC},1),calc::(findNotEmpty::(get::(${acc},index::(${dC},calc::(${nC}-14))),0)+findNotEmpty::(index::(${xC},calc::(${nC}-14)),0)),if::(eq::(${isP},1),index::(${aP},calc::(${nP}-13)),index::(${aN},calc::(${nN}-13))))]"
      }
    },
    {
